From db19cdff9a8b70332042ef9ba2e9a4d008cff25e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muse <muse@hatch.local>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 04:18:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] feat(warehouse): redesign finished goods receipt dialog

M3 redesign per spec (QUYET DINH PHASE 2):
- A2: order combobox moved to the top of the dialog; selecting an order
  auto-loads full order info + QC snapshot product lines
- C11/C12: no status column, no quantity column; each row is one item
- C8: 'Cong che tac' is now an editable textfield per row (was readonly)
- C9: 'Gia von' auto-computed via ProductionCostCalculator from per-unit
  components; 'Gia ban' is a manual textfield
- C10: no Ma hieu / Ky hieu fields
- Added: Ngay nhap date picker, Ma TP / Ma vach-QR / Nhom hang columns,
  Loai vang / Tuoi vang / DVT, TL tong / TL da / TL vang, Cong ban /
  Cong nhap manual textfields, image panel, 5-box footer totals
- Backend flow untouched: Save still bulk-posts via
  PostFinishedReceiptAsync (validate + optimistic concurrency unchanged)
---
